  "title": "The admissibility operator selects descriptions, it adds no dynamics",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "e424a758-7fcb-4579-91d5-ddca145753a4",
      "text": "An admissibility operator $\\mathcal{A}$ keeps only those descriptive structures that satisfy continuity, finite propagation, covariance, locality, stress conservation and divergence compatibility. It introduces no dynamics of its own.",
